{"name":"Mon's Lake Monster","size":"large","type":"monstrosity","tag":"","alignment":"unaligned","hitDice":"10","armorName":"natural armor","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"15 (natural armor)","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"30","customHP":false,"customSpeed":true,"hpText":"172 (15d12 + 75)","speedDesc":"6m, swim 15m","strPoints":"18","dexPoints":"12","conPoints":"16","intPoints":"5","wisPoints":"14","chaPoints":"8","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"60","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"3","customCr":"8 (3,900 XP)","customProf":3,"isLegendary":true,"legendariesDescription":"The mon's lake monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The mon's lake monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the mon's lake monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the mon's lake monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:\n- dd\n- dd","lairDescriptionEnd":"The mon's lake monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the hydra's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the hydra's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the hydra dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Amphibious","desc":"The [MON] can breathe air and water. While fully submerged, [MON] has advantage on Stealth (dex) checks and ignores difficult terrain caused by water."},{"name":"Channeling Neck","desc":"The [MON] takes 1 turn to prepare the Green Energy Beam. His neck glows green and a green energetic sphere appears in front of his mouth. If [MON] takes 10 or more damage at the neck while charging, it must succeed on a Constitution saving throw (CD 18) or the charge is interrupted and [MON] takes [1D6] force damage."}],"actions":[{"name":"Multiattack","desc":"The [MON] makes two attacks."},{"name":"Bite","desc":"_Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 3m, one target. _Hit:_ [DEX 1D10] piercing damage. The target is grappled (Strength saving throw DC [STR SAVE] to escape). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the [MON] can't bite another target."},{"name":"Pressure Fin Stroke","desc":"_Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 9m, one target. _Hit:_ [2D6] bludgeoning damage. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw [DEX SAVE] or be knocked prone."},{"name":"Green Energy Beam","desc":"_Ranged Spell Attack:_ [WIS ATK] to hit, range 18m, all targets in range. _Hit:_ A 18m long 1.5m wide bright green energy beam flashes from [MON]'s mouth. Each creature in the beam must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 16). A target takes [4D6] force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. If the beam hits water or ground, the area in a 3m radius becomes lightly obscured by magical steam until the next round."},{"name":"Flipper's Crash","desc":"_Ranged Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, range 5m, all targets in range. _Hit:_ [STR 2D6] bludgeoning damage and knock prone. On a success, it takes half damage and isn’t knocked prone."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":"Quick Dive","desc":"[MON] instantly dives beneath the surface."},{"name":"Underwater Camouflage","desc":"[MON] can move up to half its swim speed without provoking opportunity attacks."}],"reactions":[{"name":"Counter Tail","desc":"When a creature ends its turn within 3m of the tail. _Melee Weapon Attack:_ [STR ATK] to hit, reach 9m, one target. _Hit:_ [STR 1D6] bludgeoning damage. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw (DC [WIS SAVE]) or be frightened until the end of its next turn."}],"legendaries":[{"name":"Emerald Mist","desc":"_Magical fog rises from the lake._ Each creature within 9m of the shore must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw (CD [WIS SAVE]) or the area becomes lightly obscured for them until the next round. Ranged attacks beyond 9m are made with disadvantage."},{"name":"Pressure Pulse","desc":"_A deep shockwave detonates underwater._ Each creature in water must make a Constitution saving throw (CD [CON SAVE]). On a failure, the creature is pushed 5 m and can’t take reactions until the end of the round."},{"name":"Grasping Reeds","desc":"_The lake’s vegetation animates violently._ Up to 2 creatures near the shore must succeed on a Strength or Dexterity saving throw (CD [STR SAVE]) or be restrained until the end of their next turn."},{"name":"Watcher Beneath","desc":"_Glowing green shapes move under the surface._ Each enemy that can see the water must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw (CD [WIS SAVE]) or have disadvantage on Perception and Insight checks until the next round."}],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[{"name":"con","order":2},{"name":"wis","order":4}],"skills":[{"name":"athletics","stat":"str"},{"name":"perception","stat":"wis"}],"damagetypes":[],"specialdamage":[{"name":"fire (x2)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"},{"name":"when submerged bludgeoning nonmagical attacks (x0.5)","note":" (Resistant)","type":"r"},{"name":"when submerged lightning (x3)","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"conditions":[],"languages":[],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":5,"damage":[]}